---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import terms from '../../data/terms.json';
---

<Base
  title="使用條款"
  description="myLLM 產學聯盟使用條款，共十二章，涵蓋會員資格、登錄資料、使用行為、免責事項與智慧財產權。"
>
  <PageHeader title={terms.title} lead="加入會員即表示同意以下條款。" />

  <section class="top-glow mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-16">
      <nav aria-label="條款目錄" class="relative border-l pl-4 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start" style="border-color: var(--hairline)">
        <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs" style="color: var(--ink-faint)">
          <Icon name="lucide:list" class="size-3.5" />目錄
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-0.5 text-sm">
          {
            terms.sections.map((s, i) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={`#section-${i}`}
                  class="block py-1.5 transition-colors hover:text-[var(--signal)]"
                  style="color: var(--ink-soft)"
                >
                  {s.heading}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="relative max-w-2xl space-y-12">
        {
          terms.sections.map((section, i) => (
            <section id={`section-${i}`} class="scroll-mt-24 border-t pt-8" style="border-color: var(--hairline)">
              <h2 class="text-xl">{section.heading}</h2>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5">
                {section.items.map((item) => (
                  <li class="text-[15px] leading-loose" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
                    <p>{item.text}</p>
                    {item.sub && (
                      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 border-l pl-5" style="border-color: var(--hairline)">
                        {item.sub.map((sub) => (
                          <li>{sub}</li>
                        ))}
                      </ul>
                    )}
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </section>
          ))
        }
        <p class="border-t pt-6 text-xs leading-loose" style="border-color: var(--hairline); color: var(--ink-faint)">
          本頁內容由舊站 <code>/news/www/MemberAgreement.html</code> 轉為結構化資料，條文文字未做改寫。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
